{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_raven", "label": "RAVEN \u2014 rent compute, pay in SOL", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_custodial_model", "label": "Custodial balance model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:95", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Top-ups pool at one platform address and balances live as an off-chain ledger in Neon, so no on-chain program is needed; deposits are confirmed on-chain and keyed by signature so a deposit cannot credit twice."}, {"id": "readme_deposit_idempotency", "label": "Deposit idempotency by signature", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:96", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "deposits.txid is the primary key, so replaying the same top-up signature is a no-op."}, {"id": "readme_prorated_billing", "label": "Prorated pay-per-second billing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:101", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Usage is computed continuously but charged once at lease end (elapsed/3600 x rate) \u2014 no per-tick debits, which keeps Postgres writes to one row per lease."}, {"id": "readme_watchdog", "label": "Balance-exhaustion watchdog", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:103", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only asks 'is the balance exhausted?' every METER_INTERVAL_MS, so worst-case over-use is one tick."}, {"id": "readme_in_memory_state", "label": "Nodes and leases kept in memory", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:105", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A registry restart drops live sessions (their sockets die anyway); keeping them out of Postgres is what keeps heartbeats and the watchdog from writing to the DB."}, {"id": "readme_wallet_nonce_auth", "label": "Wallet nonce sign-in", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:108", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Spending a balance requires a session token minted only after signing a single-use nonce, so nobody can spend someone else's balance."}, {"id": "readme_per_lease_password", "label": "Per-lease SSH password", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:106", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The renter's wallet address is the root password on a throwaway container \u2014 fine for ephemeral compute, but a password, not a key."}, {"id": "readme_bore_tunnel", "label": "bore outbound tunnel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default TUNNEL_MODE=bore means the contributor needs no inbound ports; each SSH sandbox dials out."}, {"id": "readme_sibling_container_sandbox", "label": "Sibling-container sandbox", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:40", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The contributor mounts the host Docker socket and launches each rented sandbox on the host daemon, so nothing extra is installed."}, {"id": "readme_spa_not_ssr", "label": "Vite SPA instead of Next.js", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:110", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The wallet stack is client-only, so an SPA avoids SSR/hydration friction."}, {"id": "readme_env_precedence", "label": "Env precedence (inline > app .env > root .env)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_human_path", "label": "Human rental path", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_autonomous_path", "label": "Autonomous agent rental path", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_unpaid_payout", "label": "Unpaid payout fallback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:98", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without PLATFORM_PRIVATE_KEY the contributor's earnings are still recorded, with txid null, instead of silently vanishing."}], "edges": [{"source": "readme_custodial_model", "target": "src_solana_confirmdeposit", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:95", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_deposit_idempotency", "target": "src_db_credit", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:96", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_deposit_idempotency", "target": "readme_custodial_model", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:96", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_prorated_billing", "target": "src_billing_cost", "relation": "rationa